{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"const PUNCTUATION_KEYS: Set<PunctuationKey>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/constants.ts#L233","children":[{"type":"text","value":"constants.ts:233"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set of all valid punctuation keys commonly used in keyboard shortcuts."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"These are the literal characters as they appear in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"KeyboardEvent.key"},{"type":"text","value":" (layout-dependent,\ntypically US keyboard layout). Common shortcuts include:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+/"},{"type":"text","value":" - Toggle comment"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+["},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+]"},{"type":"text","value":" - Indent/outdent"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+="},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+-"},{"type":"text","value":" - Zoom in/out"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Note: Punctuation keys are affected by Shift (Shift+',' → '<' on US layout),\nso they're excluded from Shift-based hotkey combinations to avoid layout-dependent behavior."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nconst PUNCTUATION_KEYS: Set<PunctuationKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [constants.ts:233](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/constants.ts#L233)\n\nSet of all valid punctuation keys commonly used in keyboard shortcuts.\n\nThese are the literal characters as they appear in `KeyboardEvent.key` (layout-dependent,\ntypically US keyboard layout). Common shortcuts include:\n- `Mod+/` - Toggle comment\n- `Mod+[` / `Mod+]` - Indent/outdent\n- `Mod+=` / `Mod+-` - Zoom in/out\n\nNote: Punctuation keys are affected by Shift (Shift+',' → '<' on US layout),\nso they're excluded from Shift-based hotkey combinations to avoid layout-dependent behavior.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: PUNCTUATION_KEYS\ntitle: PUNCTUATION_KEYS\n---\n\n```ts\nconst PUNCTUATION_KEYS: Set<PunctuationKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [constants.ts:233](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/constants.ts#L233)\n\nSet of all valid punctuation keys commonly used in keyboard shortcuts.\n\nThese are the literal characters as they appear in `KeyboardEvent.key` (layout-dependent,\ntypically US keyboard layout). Common shortcuts include:\n- `Mod+/` - Toggle comment\n- `Mod+[` / `Mod+]` - Indent/outdent\n- `Mod+=` / `Mod+-` - Zoom in/out\n\nNote: Punctuation keys are affected by Shift (Shift+',' → '<' on US layout),\nso they're excluded from Shift-based hotkey combinations to avoid layout-dependent behavior.\n"}
